---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/config";
---

<Layout title={`The Structure | ${SITE.title}`}>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout">
    <section class="border-b border-border pt-12 pb-10">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-text-muted uppercase">The Structure</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl leading-tight font-bold sm:text-5xl">
        Keep your AI. Add structure.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        Structure does not replace Claude, Cursor, or your existing workflow.
        It adds deterministic boundaries so AI output can be reviewed,
        accepted, and operated safely.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-accent">
        Probabilistic AI. Deterministic structure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="the-structure" class="border-b border-border py-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">Four structural layers above your AI</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-secondary p-5">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted uppercase">Layer 1</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold">Intent</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Intent is declared once and locked. Every future change is measured
            against that intent, not against temporary chat context.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-secondary p-5">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted uppercase">Layer 2</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold">Lifecycle Enforcement</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Plan, build, control, operate. Work cannot skip stages and every
            transition must satisfy declared constraints.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-secondary p-5">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted uppercase">Layer 3</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold">Validation Loop</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Each AI change is judged deterministically with GO, FIX, or BLOCK.
            Fixable issues retry. Unsafe changes halt.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-secondary p-5">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.12em] text-text-muted uppercase">Layer 4</p>
          <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold">Persistent State</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Decisions, verdicts, and changes remain as project state across
            sessions, models, and machines.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-b border-border py-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">How it actually works</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-secondary p-5">
        <pre class="overflow-x-auto text-sm text-foreground"><code>{`Normal: Prompt -> Output -> Accept
Structured: Intent -> Draft -> Structural Check -> Policy Check -> State Update -> Accept`}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        AI proposes. The structure enforces. Nothing is accepted into project state
        without passing deterministic review.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="inside" class="border-b border-border py-12">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-text-muted uppercase">Inside the structure</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">One system. Three internal layers.</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        You install one thing. You run one thing. The internals keep AI output
        bounded, executable, and governable.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-md border border-border p-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Planning &amp; Control</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Captures intent before code is written and reviews every change with
            automated gates.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-md border border-border p-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Execution Engine</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Runs validation and enforcement locally so cloud AI is reserved for
            high-value reasoning.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-md border border-border p-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Private Mesh</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Connects your machines into one secure execution surface without
            forcing your workload into someone else&apos;s cloud.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">For engineers</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-text-secondary">
        <li>How is intent enforced at runtime?</li>
        <li>What prevents stages from being skipped?</li>
        <li>What creates a deterministic verdict?</li>
        <li>How is state reconstructed across runs?</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm">
        <a
          class="rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 font-medium transition hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
          href={SITE.links.docs}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Read Product Docs
        </a>
        <a
          class="rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 font-medium transition hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
          href={SITE.links.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          View on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
